          "description": "Qualitative velocity graph with six labelled time ticks, no numerical scale and no grid. The curve starts at the origin, has positive maxima at t₁ and t₅ and a negative minimum at t₃, crosses the time axis at t₂, t₄ and t₆, and continues downward with an arrow. The maximum at t₅ has the largest displayed magnitude. The source origin label O is omitted under the house graph convention. Bézier coordinates encode qualitative shape only.",
